  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "f256e0acf9f351c7c8d71f20f867a6132d34e4b3124895af00274dc62d80d403",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dfd7efeddeaec863e2f99952275f9b13be9085624b50b457cc37c830ff84eaea",
      "text": "悟空的\n游泳课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "221a33137ee371adf6a66c7e3c2fa2face91c41eae41aaa0a093037456210161",
      "text": "敖丙在教练身边游。\n悟空看得眼睛亮亮的：\n“我也想学！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bee78f0b15431b85a7cd09f2dadb72d1ae2e2d674b26134b4bd0d553711724df",
      "text": "可一走到池边，\n悟空又缩回了脚趾。\n“我有点怕。”\n“没关系，咱们慢慢来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e8b21bf5bb963da971b23ae83116c1918378e05c7f70d25407a7536c5eb7b52b",
      "text": "沙僧在池边陪着。\n教练伸出手：\n“准备好了吗？”\n悟空点点头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cf0a9c689db19ae6a571726b561f94aad17623a67c648d7515644a75ae047311",
      "text": "悟空扶好池边。\n教练就站在他身旁。\n敖丙轻轻拍了拍水——哗！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2ce2b9d2ee0e0e458f448d86a240d45d4f06912fe87c7cdd8d137d05585c4003",
      "text": "三只小玩具，浮呀浮。\n小鲨鱼、海星，还有小丑鱼！\n“你们也来上课呀？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37ffbe38e9bc0ba1121e409892a50b52324a719990a18470decb279bd053282e",
      "text": "教练拿来一个泡沫哑铃。\n两头蓝蓝的，又大又轻。\n悟空乐了：\n“小鱼也要练力气吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b675786aa2622532df02a8f10255fad682fb70713c09c09655c3727e048a6d1f",
      "text": "“这是帮咱们练习的。”\n悟空笑了，\n手还稳稳扶着池边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43f5d59eff4371a5c748a447f4a73a1b5bd8cc185b9b19614a93d23d8854fc28",
      "text": "教练把嘴轻轻贴近水面。\n咕噜，咕噜——\n悟空也吹出了小泡泡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "afe447422d3ff67bfdd592db3e3a7e38166ab4ab03326a4be6220cdc8be5f9a4",
      "text": "水花碰到了下巴。\n悟空抬起脸，眨眨眼。\n“歇一会儿吧。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a58edc4d524d2a3bb26c6f84b6375733a922e09489fe5f472d694458f04c0cac",
      "text": "又来上课啦。\n悟空扶好池边：\n“我的小泡泡又回来啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2c066f2e176a1834af1465daf30dfb91ef23cc23afb7c26298e50d51dae0cf4b",
      "text": "“教练，扶着我漂一会儿吧。”\n“好，我扶着呢。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bba962249796a9f7f4f552fef8ab14bc20e11088b6cf4854798a7636b98de091",
      "text": "教练托着悟空，他慢慢漂起来。\n小肚皮像一只小船。\n“还是一只带尾巴的小船！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "931476a380e78fc6cdb1f3aeca5f863b256690e68a117ad6c662cd8197e58dce",
      "text": "又来上课啦。\n这回练习踢腿。\n“腿伸长，膝盖放松。”\n悟空把腿向后伸长。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02b02525d078c0aa57a46bf414ede73646c874ee347e284a80be07dc26ac3f36",
      "text": "“膝盖放松，轻轻踢。”\n水花变小啦。\n敖丙笑着说：\n“小鲨鱼也在看你呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7568396dbc299e1fc9e57ecafeb1a3100601021ecd3ca0ce6b691f2c855cc76b",
      "text": "悟空握好泡沫哑铃。\n“头朝下，看水里。”\n他低头吹着泡泡，轻轻踢腿。\n教练一直扶着他。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b1899beffbb13092a373c768d13e9c5483c8d1525fd1ca71c9519c452410c95c",
      "text": "又练了几次，\n悟空想试试不用哑铃。\n“教练，你就在我身边吗？”\n“就在你身旁。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "996d82671b6e7fb18e2027ff6f484d87a8793f5bef3a6a2a3d4f25f0fb821be7",
      "text": "悟空向前游了一小段。\n教练就跟在旁边。\n悟空转向池边，伸手扶稳。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "517289facc5072e0b0f0eaf53d89fb15516de3d03427fea64a31df413f85e392",
      "text": "“我游了一小段！”\n“我看见啦！”敖丙笑着说。\n下课了，教练扶悟空上台阶。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b12139dba5ce34d9a82f0f7d6cfe0f3a724eecb4373641a01168c6db187f69d5",
      "text": "三只小玩具，都回篮子啦。\n“晚安，小鲨鱼。”\n“今天你也忙坏啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
